# Phase 32, after the close: a 12mm curved slot floor walled on BOTH sides — the rail of
# walled_rails' fork 0 with room for a 10mm tool. The inner wall is 7.5mm
# thick, thinner than the tool's 10mm push, so the pushed swath closes all
# the way round it: the neighbour is an ISLAND of the swath, not a bite out
# of it. Until then this refused ("the region folds back on itself").
units mm
feed 800
plunge 300
rapid_z 5
clearance_z 25
spindle 3000
stock Box(w=70, l=70, h=20, x=0, y=0, z=0)
tool T5 Endmill(dia=10.0)
